Subject: [PATCH] Implement calcPerspectiveSkillDistance function

- Added calcPerspectiveSkillDistance function declaration to inputconvertgame.h
- Implemented calcPerspectiveSkillDistance in inputconvertgame.cpp with detailed comments
- Replaced 3 instances of duplicated perspective calculation code with calls to the new function
- The function encapsulates the perspective transformation logic for MOBA skill/wheel distance calculations
- Uses perspective scale based on vertical position (0.6 * rawDistance.y() + 1) to simulate depth effect
- Applies non-linear scaling for both horizontal and vertical distances
